   (c) that directly or indirectly supports earning income.

   If it is unclear whether a use is Non-commercial Use, it is Commercial Use.

   "Pro Features" means the features we identify as such in the Software or on our website,
   including remote SFTP. We decide which features are Pro Features.

   "Licence" means a paid licence purchased from us or our authorised reseller and
   identified by a licence key.

